# Books Cited by *Natural Language Processing with Python*

This page collects the **book-length works cited in the bibliography of *****Natural Language Processing with Python*** by Steven Bird, Ewan Klein, and Edward Loper.

* **Book:** [Natural Language Processing with Python](https://www.nltk.org/book_1ed/)
* **NLTK bibliography:** https://www.nltk.org/book_1ed/bibliography.html
* **Published by:** O'Reilly Media
* **Publication:** 2009
* **Authors:** Steven Bird, Ewan Klein, Edward Loper

The links below point to publisher pages, DOI records, institutional pages, or Google Books records where an authoritative publisher page was not readily available.

> **Note:** The editions and publication years in the table follow the NLTK bibliography. Where a publisher now provides a later edition, the table generally links to the record for the edition cited by NLTK when that record is available.

